{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>Write this for a memorial.</b> For Amalek came to intercept Israel before all the other nations." "<b>And place it in the ears of Yehoshua.</b> Who brings Israel into the land — that he should command Israel to repay him his due. Here it was hinted to Moses that Yehoshua would bring Israel into the land (ibid.)." "<b>For I will utterly blot out.</b> Therefore I warn you thus, for I desire to blot him out."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:52:51.701057310Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}